{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Efficiency measures the proportion of the total energy input that is transferred usefully. The equation is efficiency equals useful energy output divided by total energy input. To express efficiency as a percentage, multiply the decimal answer by one hundred. You can also calculate efficiency using useful power output divided by total power input. Use energy with energy, or power with power; do not mix them in the same ratio.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": true}", "duration": 34.586122, "words": [["Efficiency", 0.0], ["measures", 0.836], ["the", 1.347], ["proportion", 1.509], ["of", 2.252], ["the", 2.45], ["total", 2.589], ["energy", 3.088], ["input", 3.611], ["that", 4.191], ["is", 4.458], ["transferred", 4.609], ["usefully.", 5.259], ["The", 6.432], ["equation", 6.618], ["is", 7.361], ["efficiency", 7.628], ["equals", 8.533], ["useful", 9.044], ["energy", 9.52], ["output", 10.031], ["divided", 10.751], ["by", 11.424], ["total", 11.668], ["energy", 12.237], ["input.", 12.806], ["To", 13.839], ["express", 14.095], ["efficiency", 14.629], ["as", 15.395], ["a", 15.662], ["percentage,", 15.766], ["multiply", 16.904], ["the", 17.636], ["decimal", 17.775], ["answer", 18.355], ["by", 18.855], ["one", 19.087], ["hundred.", 19.342], ["You", 20.376], ["can", 20.55], ["also", 20.759], ["calculate", 21.119], ["efficiency", 21.78], ["using", 22.57], ["useful", 22.999], ["power", 23.545], ["output", 23.951], ["divided", 24.903], ["by", 25.577], ["total", 25.879], ["power", 26.413], ["input.", 26.912], ["Use", 28.085], ["energy", 28.444], ["with", 29.002], ["energy,", 29.269], ["or", 30.035], ["power", 30.325], ["with", 30.801], ["power;", 31.068], ["do", 31.951], ["not", 32.194], ["mix", 32.45], ["them", 32.752], ["in", 33.054], ["the", 33.228], ["same", 33.367], ["ratio.", 33.704]], "raw": [{"text": "Efficiency", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.72}, {"text": "measures", "start": 0.836, "end": 1.3}, {"text": "the", "start": 